  "description": "Ultra-low-latency, Native AOT web and LLM inference microservices engine for .NET 10. Features PagedAttention, Continuous Iteration Batching, SIMD HTTP delimiter scanning, zero-allocation Radix Tree routing, Glacier.Storage Arrow streaming, direct Polaris/Tensor streaming, and Autonomous Sleep Consolidation Daemons.",
