  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Introduces AutonomousSleepDaemon for autonomous wake-sleep consolidation life-cycle management (arXiv:2606.03979). Continuously tracks inference request quiescence, schedules sleep consolidation upon token idle thresholds, triggers offline MoE parameter expansion and GKD knowledge distillation, prunes volatile continuum memory buffers, and seamlessly transitions back to serving without downtime. Updates Glacier.Inference to v1.5.0 and Glacier.Tune to v1.1.0.",
